{"scene_id": "s01882", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01882.fountain", "heading": "INT. PROVINCIAL RAILWAY WAITING ROOM - NIGHT", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "SIMONE DUVALIER", "names": ["SIMONE DUVALIER", "SIMONE"], "gender": "?", "first": 5, "spoke": 19}, {"id": 1, "name": "HENRIK ASTRUP", "names": ["HENRIK ASTRUP", "HENRIK"], "gender": "f", "first": 6, "spoke": 19}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. PROVINCIAL RAILWAY WAITING ROOM - NIGHT", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A potbellied stove.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A clock that has been wrong for years.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "Two benches.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "One lamp.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "SIMONE DUVALIER (60s, widow's black, one suitcase) sits stiffly.", "para": 0, "sent": 4, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "HENRIK ASTRUP (60s, overcoat, cane) sits on the other bench, not looking at her.", "para": 0, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You have been staring at that clock for an hour.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's wrong.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It has been wrong since the war.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then why don't they fix it?", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Perhaps they prefer it that way. Perhaps everyone who passes through here prefers one clock that lies.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Madame, do I know you?", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You look at me as though I should.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You are mistaken. I was looking at your cane.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was my father's.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is a handsome cane.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was the only thing he left me. That and a quarrel I never finished.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "With whom?", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "With him. He died before I could win it.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Those are the ones that last. The quarrels with the dead.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": ["a small laugh"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You speak as one who knows.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I buried a husband in March. We were not speaking when he fell ill. I thought there would be a better time.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There never is.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Where do you travel?", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "To my sister's. She lives at the end of the line. She has not spoken to me in twenty years, and she has written to say she is dying.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And you will go?", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I have a ticket.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That is not an answer.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is the only one I have tonight.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My train comes at seven. I am going to my son. He has not spoken to me in nine years.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["after a moment"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then we are both late.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It would seem so.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Do you know what I think, Monsieur Astrup?", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You know my name.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It is on your suitcase. I have read it eleven times.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then you may as well call me Henrik.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["smiling for the first time"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Simone.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Simone. What do you think?", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I think the clock is not wrong at all. I think it shows the hour when each of us should have left.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And what hour is it?", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "For you, nine years ago. For me, twenty.", "name": "SIMONE", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then let us be early for the next one.", "name": "HENRIK", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "A whistle in the distance.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Both rise.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "He offers his arm.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "She takes it.", "para": 1, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1]}]}